gs/ga/gap/gc   git status / add -A . / add -p / commit
gcm/gb/gcb/gco commit -m / branch / current branch / checkout
gg             pretty graph log
gclean [-D]    delete local branches whose remote is gone
la / ll        list incl. dotfiles / detailed
md             mkdir and enter it
clean          remove everything in current dir (asks first)
fs / port      size of path / who listens on port
extract        unpack any archive
mark/j/marks   bookmark dirs and jump back
rl             reload dotfiles
pg             pgrep -lf
